csbm-ensemble-csbm_h1                            csbm-vanilla-csbm_h1                     cpu  source scripts/campaigns/env.sh && CGNN_CKPT_DIR=checkpoints/aistats/csbm cgnn sweep -m ensemble -d csbm_h1 -p graph-uncertainty-aistats-csbm --cpu
